cext
------------------------------------------
This is libcext, ESO's C Library Extensions. It is a C utility library, which
is used to implement ESO's Common Pipeline Library (CPL).

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcext-devel-1.3.2-1bl1
  libcext0-1.3.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://www.eso.org/sci/software/cpl/

Canonical download:
  https://ftp.eso.org/pub/dfs/pipelines/libraries/cext/cext-1.3.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cext-1.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cext-1.3.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cext-1.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cext-1.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcext0-1.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcext-devel-1.3.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

